[ti:Little Tomcat (đoạn học)]
[ar:Josh Woodward]
[by:SingLearn - Nhom 10 (faster-whisper small alignment)]
[00:02.68]Little tomcat, stay close to me
[00:05.80]Cuz there are clouds on the horizon
[00:08.80]And a chill on the breeze
[00:14.20]We're alone here, but don't you be scared
[00:18.20]I've got a calloused hand, a farmer's tan
[00:21.32]And I'm happy to share
[00:24.76]You and I will both get by
[00:29.32]Just promise you won't stray
[00:35.12]All that I need is some dirt and a seed
[00:39.50]And I will feed you till the summer blows away
[00:44.78]
